# `Thunk` mode's own on-disk representation (`.dyndrv/thunks/`,
# `.dyndrv/thunks-drv/`, `.dyndrv/groups/`) -- a workspace-relative
# scratch directory created by running the compiled shim locally (e.g.
# via `nix develop`'s own devShell, or any of the rust/dyndrv-shim/
# *-test.sh fixtures), never meant to be committed.
/.dyndrv/
